WEBVTT

00:03:26.577 --> 00:03:30.039
and to see not just the parts
of the world that are obvious

00:03:30.039 --> 00:03:32.792
but the parts of the world
that we don't often talk about,

00:03:32.833 --> 00:03:34.418
the social silences.

00:03:36.128 --> 00:03:37.797
Now I used that framework

00:03:37.838 --> 00:03:42.385
to help me predict
the great financial crisis in 2008.

00:03:43.052 --> 00:03:44.262
In particular,

00:03:44.303 --> 00:03:48.432
I spent much of the years before that
going to investment banking conferences,

00:03:48.474 --> 00:03:50.977
which are gigantic ceremonial rituals,

00:03:50.977 --> 00:03:53.104
which are rather similar
to Tajik weddings.

00:03:53.104 --> 00:03:54.730
(Laughter)

00:03:54.730 --> 00:03:55.898
It's true.

00:03:55.940 --> 00:03:58.526
They pull people together,
the scattered tribe,

00:03:58.567 --> 00:04:00.403
they reaffirm their social ties